<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="803632734"/></metadata></head><body dur="4:28.333"><div begin="18.445" end="47.162" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="18.445" end="25.241" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="18.445" end="18.718">和</span><span begin="18.718" end="19.137">你</span><span begin="19.137" end="19.460">并</span><span begin="19.460" end="20.397">肩同</span><span begin="20.397" end="21.344">行</span> <span begin="21.972" end="22.434">一起</span><span begin="22.434" end="22.830">走</span><span begin="22.830" end="23.154">过</span><span begin="23.154" end="23.645">各</span><span begin="23.645" end="24.159">种天</span><span begin="24.159" end="25.241">气</span></p><p begin="25.665" end="33.228" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="25.665" end="26.178">再</span><span begin="26.178" end="27.248">冷</span> <span begin="27.950" end="28.410">我</span><span begin="28.410" end="28.712">都</span><span begin="28.712" end="29.653">不觉</span><span begin="29.653" end="31.271">得</span><span begin="31.271" end="31.609">委</span><span begin="31.609" end="33.228">屈</span></p><p begin="34.975" end="42.116" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="34.975" end="35.289">但</span><span begin="35.289" end="35.738">生</span><span begin="35.738" end="35.978">命</span><span begin="35.978" end="36.696">转</span><span begin="36.696" end="37.110">了</span><span begin="37.110" end="38.229">弯</span> <span begin="38.706" end="39.104">慌乱</span><span begin="39.104" end="39.525">间</span><span begin="39.525" end="39.760">我</span><span begin="39.760" end="40.651">回头</span><span begin="40.651" end="42.116">看</span></p><p begin="43.329" end="47.162" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="43.329" end="43.610">却</span><span begin="43.610" end="44.621">失去你</span><span begin="44.621" end="45.452">的</span><span begin="45.452" end="45.928">踪</span><span begin="45.928" end="47.162">迹</span></p></div><div begin="48.041" end="1:16.632" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="48.041" end="54.780" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="48.041" end="48.238">不</span><span begin="48.238" end="48.729">想</span><span begin="48.729" end="48.964">一</span><span begin="48.964" end="49.871">睡不</span><span begin="49.871" end="50.857">醒</span> <span begin="51.478" end="51.970">免得</span><span begin="51.970" end="52.659">错过</span><span begin="52.659" end="53.161">你</span><span begin="53.161" end="53.584">的消</span><span begin="53.584" end="54.780">息</span></p><p begin="55.451" end="1:02.383" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="55.451" end="55.722">忍</span><span begin="55.722" end="56.139">着</span><span begin="56.139" end="57.294">痛</span> <span begin="57.294" end="57.503">忍</span><span begin="57.503" end="57.945">不</span><span begin="57.945" end="58.205">住</span><span begin="58.205" end="58.676">了</span> <span begin="58.676" end="59.083">我</span><span begin="59.083" end="59.305">就</span><span begin="59.305" end="1:00.634">深</span><span begin="1:00.634" end="1:01.048">呼</span><span begin="1:01.048" end="1:02.383">吸</span></p><p begin="1:02.824" end="1:09.975" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:02.824" end="1:03.074">你</span><span begin="1:03.074" end="1:03.579">说</span><span begin="1:03.579" end="1:03.799">过</span><span begin="1:03.799" end="1:04.691">的永</span><span begin="1:04.691" end="1:06.030">远</span> <span begin="1:06.222" end="1:06.703">说</span><span begin="1:06.703" end="1:07.212">好</span><span begin="1:07.212" end="1:07.432">要</span><span begin="1:07.432" end="1:08.331">带我</span><span begin="1:08.331" end="1:09.975">去</span></p><p begin="1:11.027" end="1:16.632" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:11.027" end="1:11.311">心</span><span begin="1:11.311" end="1:11.721">刮</span><span begin="1:11.721" end="1:12.019">着</span><span begin="1:12.019" end="1:12.285">风</span> <span begin="1:12.285" end="1:12.667">下</span><span begin="1:12.667" end="1:13.009">着</span><span begin="1:13.009" end="1:13.201">雨</span> <span begin="1:13.201" end="1:13.618">想</span><span begin="1:13.618" end="1:13.909">着</span><span begin="1:13.909" end="1:14.162">你</span><span begin="1:14.162" end="1:14.913">往</span><span begin="1:14.913" end="1:15.574">前</span><span begin="1:15.574" end="1:16.632">进</span></p></div><div begin="1:16.792" end="1:49.630" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:16.792" end="1:23.619" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:16.792" end="1:17.903">Oh</span> <span begin="1:17.903" end="1:19.140">爱</span> <span begin="1:19.151" end="1:19.540">请</span><span begin="1:19.540" end="1:21.047">问</span><span begin="1:21.047" end="1:21.426">怎</span><span begin="1:21.426" end="1:22.023">么</span><span begin="1:22.023" end="1:23.619">走</span></p><p begin="1:24.022" end="1:28.849" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:24.022" end="1:24.319">我</span><span begin="1:24.319" end="1:25.229">一个人</span><span begin="1:25.229" end="1:26.139">翻过山</span> <span begin="1:26.139" end="1:27.019">越过海</span> <span begin="1:27.019" end="1:27.959">只为你</span><span begin="1:27.959" end="1:28.849">对我好过</span></p><p begin="1:28.859" end="1:31.465" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:28.859" end="1:29.256">这</span><span begin="1:29.256" end="1:29.773">份爱</span><span begin="1:29.773" end="1:30.205">前</span><span begin="1:30.205" end="1:30.775">所未</span><span begin="1:30.775" end="1:31.465">有</span></p><p begin="1:31.616" end="1:38.046" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:31.616" end="1:32.595">Oh</span> <span begin="1:32.595" end="1:33.981">爱</span> <span begin="1:33.981" end="1:34.231">为</span><span begin="1:34.231" end="1:35.777">什</span><span begin="1:35.777" end="1:36.105">么</span><span begin="1:36.105" end="1:36.835">不</span><span begin="1:36.835" end="1:38.046">走</span></p><p begin="1:38.768" end="1:43.652" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:38.768" end="1:39.062">我</span><span begin="1:39.062" end="1:39.982">也不懂</span><span begin="1:39.982" end="1:40.903">谁劝我</span> <span begin="1:40.903" end="1:41.82